which the US says is no longer their focus.&nbsp;

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:26.280
Mohammad Marandi, professor at Tehran&nbsp;
University and political analyst:&nbsp;

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:31.260
“We all know that the whole process&nbsp;
is politicized but the Iranians are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:36.180
