Mashhad, Arak, Zahedan, Mahabad and parts of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:30.060
Tehran. They're not dying down at all, are they?
No, I didn't try to do anything. I said the truth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:37.320
The protests in the first couple of days were&nbsp;
larger and they were in different cities. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:44.940
